{"id":"n29551-2-7","stage":2,"title":"전쟁 · 战争","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29551-2-7-1","ko":"아, 오늘도 출근길이 너무 막히네.","zh":"啊，今天上班的路也堵得要命啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咳","explanation":"아：咳。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"3","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘도","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘도","audio":"/audio/77d25b815bea9e75c627.mp3"}},{"text":"출근길이","meaning":"上班路上，上班途中","explanation":"출근길：上班路上，上班途中；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"출근길","audio":"/audio/5f9dfb0f54bfb0bf6dbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79079","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출근길이","audio":"/audio/972fc1cc4ba7a1690102.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"막히네.","meaning":"堵住","explanation":"막히다：堵住；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"막히다","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29777","senseId":"6","lemma":"막히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막히네","audio":"/audio/6d30543861d4338dfd78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咳","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到烦恼、担心、惋惜、叹息时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/a